0b89a-e487-49f8-bab8-b5bab16be14c</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item></items><chunks count="1"><chunk name="Container"><items count="8"><item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item><item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">2fea9101-fbf2-44b3-969d-dcb7da92143e</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item><item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10"></item><item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item><item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item><item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">TURNING BRICKS ON RODS · GRADIENT · گرادیان
Open hero-rod-facade-context.3dm first (the house); use the Front view — the street is on the −Y side. Units: metres.

Rod Screen: 16 × 12 m, one-hole Iranian bricks on vertical steel rods, 15 mm spacers, 30 mm side gap
(≥ brick diagonal − length, so any turn of any neighbour is collision-free).
Facade Pattern → T turns each brick up to 80° (Brick Operation mode 4, 10° steps) and C + P choose the glaze
of each brick's ends (Glazed Ends; only bricks turned ≥ 8° are glazed; colours blend brick by brick).
Change P on Facade Pattern for another picture; Scale / X / Y move and size it.
Site: Raj sheet = rod by rod, bottom to top: turn and glaze of every brick · Stencils = one angle template per turn.</item></items><chunks count="2"><chunk name="Attributes"><items count="5"><item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35"><X>40</X><Y>20</Y><W>820</W><H>200</H></item><item name="MarginLeft" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item><item name="MarginRight" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item><item name="MarginTop" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item><item name="Pivot" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31"><X>450.0</X><Y>120.0</Y></item></items></chunk><chunk name="PanelProperties"><items count="7"><item name="Colour" type_name="gh_drawing_color" type_code="36"><ARGB>255;255;250;90</ARGB></item><item name="DrawIndices" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item><item name="DrawPaths" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item><item name="Multiline" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item><item name="SpecialCodes" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="Stream" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="Wrap" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item></items></chunk></chunks></chunk></chunks></chunk><chunk name="Object" index="1"><items count="2"><item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">fbac3e32-f100-4292-8692-77240a42fd1a</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Point</item></items><chunks count="1"><chunk name="Container"><items count="6"><item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Contains a collection of three-dimensional points</item><item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">8a472f6a-bbea-4412-9f6e-61ed14c89c22</item><item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Point</item><item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Pt</item><item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item><item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item></items><chu